<title>UK: INSIGHT - PRECIOUS METALS TO STABILISE, WATCH PGMS.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - PRECIOUS METALS TO STABILISE, WATCH PGMS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> SPOT     NY CLOSE  * SUPPORT * RESIST * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA30</p>
<p> GOLD   318.30/8.60 *  315.00 * 321.00 *    35 * 323.97 * 324.56</p>
<p> SILVER   4.34/4.36 *    4.30 *   4.40 *    43 *   4.38 *   4.40</p>
<p> PLAT   431.00/2.00 *  420.00 * 455.00 *    54 * 433.14 * 418.50</p>
<p>-----------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - Aug 7 ---------------</p>
<p>Precious metal markets are likely to consolidate on Thursday, with gold and silver holding above $315.00 and $4.30 an ounce respectively, analysts said.</p>
<p>This trend follows Wednesday's action, when downtrends were put on hold. However, bullion markets remain sensitive to events in the volatile PGMs. Both platinum and palladium are under pressure again, they noted.</p>
